    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d430e7b996d246c3607434",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……每每想起刚才的失态，我都会捂住脸。\n在即将迎来重要比赛的担当赛马娘面前，\n紧张得如此明显实在有失训练员的身份。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7712308332201921152e2a0b3976811eef9c4a6970d94803fc84cf15b872ff22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
